#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "There are two support collection methods, the first utilizes the legacy flow-tools binaries and the second leverages Cacti's own PHP based flow stream server."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin tattarawa guda biyu da ake goyon baya, ta farko tana amfani da tsofaffin fayilolin flow-tools kuma ta biyu tana amfani da sabar kwararar bayanai ta Cacti da aka gina da PHP."

#: flowview_devices.php
