#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "If Cacti server has more IP Addresses, you can specify specific interface. Leave as 0.0.0.0 for primary interface."
msgstr "Idan sabar Cacti tana da ƙarin Adiresoshin IP, za ku iya zaɓar takamaiman hanyar haɗi. Bar shi a matsayin 0.0.0.0 don hanyar haɗi ta farko."

#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "Allowed Host Range"
msgstr "Kewayon Mai Masauki da Aka Ba da Izini"

#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "IP Address of the device that is allowed to send to this flow collector.  Leave as 0.0.0.0 for any host.  Note that PHP is finicky about what it allows.  CIDR syntax is supported as well as range syntax for example 192.168.1.0 or 192.168.1.0/24.  If you want specific IP addresses, separate them by a comma."
msgstr "Adireshin IP na na'urar da aka ba izinin aikawa zuwa wannan mai tattara bayanai na flow.  Bar shi a matsayin 0.0.0.0 ga kowane mai masauki.  Lura cewa PHP tana da tsauri game da abin da take yarda da shi.  Ana goyan bayan tsarin rubutu na CIDR da kuma tsarin zango misali 192.168.1.0 ko 192.168.1.0/24.  Idan kuna son takamaiman adiresoshin IP, ku raba su da waƙafi."

