#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Shirye-shiryen sakamako yana fara lissafa sakamakon Tacewa na kowane ɓangaren kwararar bayanai, tare da NAT a kunne da a kashe, sannan ya adana su a cikin ma'ajiyar Parallel Query, domin rahotanni kan tsofaffin bayanai su buɗe da sauri.  Sabbin ɓangarori ana shirya musu sakamako ta atomatik da zarar sun daina karɓar kwararar bayanai.  Ana buƙata yana nufin ɓangarorin da suka juya ba a shirya musu sakamako ba tukuna, Yana aiki yana nufin ana kan aikin shirya sakamako, kuma Sabuntacce yana nufin kowane ɓangare da ya juya an shirya masa sakamako.  Yana aiki: N yana nuna adadin tambayoyin Tacewa da ke aiki a yanzu.  Ɓangaren da har yanzu ke karɓar kwararar bayanai ba a shirya masa sakamako ba, don haka ba ya cikin lissafi."

