#: setup.php
msgid "Provide the IPv4 ip address range for your local network for hosts that may not be registered in DNS.  These hosts will be mapped to the Local Domain Name above.  This more for home users.  You can use either CIDR or non-CIDR formats.  For example: 192.168.11.0 or 192.168.11.0/24"
msgstr "Bayar da kewayon adireshin IP na IPv4 don hanyar sadarwar gidanku don masu masauki waɗanda ba za a yi musu rajista a cikin DNS ba. Za a haɗa waɗannan masu masauki zuwa Sunan Yanki na Gida da ke sama. Wannan ya fi dacewa da masu amfani a gida. Kuna iya amfani da tsarin CIDR ko wanda ba CIDR ba. Misali: 192.168.11.0 ko 192.168.11.0/24"

#: setup.php
msgid "Use CIDR or Non-CIDR"
msgstr "Yi amfani da CIDR ko Wanda Ba CIDR Ba"

#: setup.php
msgid "Use Arin to find Domains and AS Numbers"
msgstr "Yi amfani da Arin don nemo Yankunan Domains da Lambobin AS"

#: setup.php
msgid "Many Big Tech data collection services like to mask their ownership of domains to obfuscate the fact that they are collecting your personal information.  If you are concerned with this and your Cacti install has access to the Internet, you can use Arin to remove the mask from those Big Tech companies."
msgstr "Yawancin manyan kamfanonin fasaha masu tattara bayanai suna son ɓoye mallakar sunayen yankinsu (domains) don rufe gaskiyar cewa suna tattara bayanan ku na sirri. Idan wannan yana damun ku kuma Cacti ɗin ku yana da damar shiga Intanet, kuna iya amfani da Arin don cire rufin asiri daga waɗancan manyan kamfanonin fasaha."

